{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8582-1",
  "summary": "jbig2dec vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Zeng Yunxiang and Song Jiaxuan discovered that jbig2dec had an\nout-of-bounds read vulnerability in its command-line tool. An attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to cause jbig2dec to crash, resulting in a\ndenial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 22.04 LTS.\n(CVE-2023-46361)\n\nIt was discovered that jbig2dec had an integer overflow in the\njbig2_arith_iaid_ctx_new() function. An attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-38076)",
